==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20~21.33 seconds<sup>600f~640f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

